65519
x1+x2+x3+x4+x5+x6,
x1*x2+x2*x3+x3*x4+x4*x5+x5*x6+x6*x1,
x1*x2*x3+x2*x3*x4+x3*x4*x5+x4*x5*x6+x5*x6*x1+x6*x1*x2,
x1*x2*x3*x4+x2*x3*x4*x5+x3*x4*x5*x6+x4*x5*x6*x1+x5*x6*x1*x2+x6*x1*x2*x3,
